<%- include('../partials/head',{title}) %>
<body><%- include('../partials/header') %><main class="section admin-inbox-page"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> ADMIN</div><h1>Admin Console</h1><p>Generate professional appointment letters and retrieve previously issued files.</p></div></div><nav class="admin-console-tabs" aria-label="Admin sections"><a href="/admin/inbox">Communications</a><a href="/admin/offers" aria-current="page">Offers</a></nav><div class="section-head admin-subhead"><div><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> OFFERS</div><h2 id="offerFormTitle">Generate offer letter</h2></div></div><p class="admin-offer-intro">Complete the recipient and offer details. The right column contains the employment terms used to produce the letter. All fields are editable before generation.</p><div class="admin-offer-layout"><form id="adminOfferForm" class="admin-offer-form"><input type="hidden" name="baseVersionId" id="baseVersionId"><div class="admin-offer-edit-mode" id="offerEditMode" hidden><span id="offerEditLabel"></span><button type="button" class="admin-offers-refresh" id="newOfferButton">Start a new offer</button></div><section class="admin-offer-card"><h3>Offer details</h3><label>Offer date<input name="offerDate" type="date" required></label><label>Position name<input name="position" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Software Quality Analyst"></label><label>Date of joining<input name="joiningDate" type="date" required></label><label>Salary per month<input name="salary" required maxlength="80" placeholder="SGD $4,000"></label><label>Country of offer<select name="country" id="offerCountry" required><option>Singapore</option><option>India</option><option>Malaysia</option><option>Japan</option><option>Australia</option><option>New Zealand</option><option>United States</option><option>Switzerland</option><option>Other</option></select><small class="admin-offer-country-note">Singapore defaults follow MOM guidance. For another country, add its required local terms and review them before issue.</small></label><label>Office address (shown on the right side of the letterhead)<textarea name="officeAddress" required maxlength="300" rows="3" placeholder="No. 2 Venture Drive, #22-28 Vision Exchange, Singapore 608526"></textarea></label><label id="otherCountryWrap" hidden>Country name<input name="otherCountry" maxlength="80"></label><label>Head of Human Resources<input name="hrName" required maxlength="120"></label><label>Candidate name<input name="candidate" required maxlength="120"></label><label>Candidate address (printed under the candidate name in the top-right “To” block)<textarea name="address" required maxlength="800" rows="4" placeholder="Street, city, postal code, country"></textarea></label></section><section class="admin-offer-card"><h3>Employment terms</h3><p class="admin-offer-hint">These fields follow the supplied appointment-letter sample. Review and edit each term for the role and country.</p><label>Duties<textarea name="duties" rows="3" maxlength="1600" placeholder="Duties within the framework of the role"></textarea></label><label>Probation period<input name="probation" maxlength="240" placeholder="Three months"></label><label>Working hours and breaks<textarea name="workingHours" rows="3" maxlength="600" placeholder="Include work days, hours, breaks and rest day"></textarea></label><label>Salary payment timing<input name="payday" maxlength="240" placeholder="Within 7 days after salary period ends"></label><label>Annual leave<textarea name="annualLeave" rows="3" maxlength="600"></textarea></label><label>Sick leave<textarea name="sickLeave" rows="3" maxlength="600"></textarea></label><label>Notice period<input name="notice" maxlength="400" placeholder="One month, or salary in lieu where permitted by law"></label><label>Benefits<textarea name="benefits" rows="3" maxlength="800" placeholder="Medical insurance, life insurance, or other benefits"></textarea></label><label>Other work terms<textarea name="outsideWork" rows="3" maxlength="800" placeholder="Optional restrictions or approval process"></textarea></label><label>Tax wording<input name="tax" maxlength="400" placeholder="Personal income tax responsibility"></label><label>Additional terms<textarea name="additionalTerms" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Any further agreed terms"></textarea></label></section><div class="admin-offer-actions"><button class="btn primary" id="generateOfferButton" type="submit">Generate</button><p id="adminOfferStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><section id="generatedOffer" class="admin-generated-offer" hidden></section></form><aside class="admin-saved-offers"><h3>Saved offers</h3><p>PDF and JSON files are stored in the private Offers folder on the server. Downloads require admin access.</p><button class="btn admin-offers-refresh" type="button" id="refreshOffers">Refresh offers</button><p id="savedOffersStatus" role="status">Loading saved offers…</p><section id="savedOffersList" class="admin-saved-offers-list" aria-label="Previously generated offers"></section></aside></div></div></main><script src="/assets/js/admin-offers.js?v=20261103-3" defer></script><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
